@url_shortening_service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5184

### Create short URL (expect 201)
POST {{url_shortening_service_HostAddress}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.example.com/some/long/url"
}

###

### Second create (expect 201, new id and shortCode)
POST {{url_shortening_service_HostAddress}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.google.com"
}